<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="dark" lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>

<body class="bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark text-white">
    <div class="relative flex h-auto min-h-screen w-full flex-col overflow-x-hidden">
        <%- include('partials/header') %>
            <main class="flex flex-col flex-1 px-4 md:px-20 py-12">
                <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto w-full space-y-12">
                    <!-- Intro -->
                    <section class="text-center space-y-6">
                        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold font-mono-header text-amber-yellow">About HeritEdge
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 font-mono leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                            HeritEdge is a digital platform designed to promote and sell cultural and traditional
                            artwork while hosting events that connect artists with audiences.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <!-- Mission & Creation -->
                    <section class="bg-deep-maroon/20 p-8 rounded-sm border border-rich-red/30 space-y-4">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono-header text-white border-l-4 border-amber-yellow pl-4">
                            Our Mission & Inspiration</h2>
                        <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                            HeritEdge was created to empower marginalized and traditional artists by providing them with
                            a space to showcase and sell their cultural artwork directly to a global audience. The
                            inspiration behind building the platform was to bridge the gap between talented traditional
                            creators and art enthusiasts who appreciate authentic cultural heritage.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                            By facilitating direct sales, the platform supports the creative community, allowing artists
                            to sustain their livelihoods while preserving traditional art forms that might otherwise be
                            lost.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <!-- Events & Connection -->
                    <section class="bg-deep-maroon/20 p-8 rounded-sm border border-rich-red/30 space-y-4">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono-header text-white border-l-4 border-amber-yellow pl-4">
                            Connecting Through Events</h2>
                        <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                            Beyond being a marketplace, HeritEdge is a cultural hub. We host exhibitions, workshops, and
                            artist talks that bring the community together. These events are designed to give audiences
                            a hands-on experience and a deeper understanding of the traditions behind the artwork,
                            fostering a profound connection between artists and audiences.
                        </p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </main>
            <footer class="mt-auto border-t border-[#f3efe7] dark:border-[#3a3224] py-8 px-10">
                <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="h-6 w-auto overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
                            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="HeritEdge" class="h-full w-auto object-contain" />
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold opacity-60">© 2023 HeritEdge Nepal</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex gap-8 text-sm font-medium opacity-60">
                        <a class="hover:text-primary" href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
                        <a class="hover:text-primary" href="#">Terms of Service</a>
                        <a class="hover:text-primary" href="#">Contact Us</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </footer>
    </div>
</body>

</html>